			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Remove empty Permission validation stub\n\nDelete the `ValidatePermission.rs` file which was present as an empty placeholder with no implementation. This cleanup removes dead code artifacts from the `Source/IPC/Permission/Validate` directory, streamlining the permission handling module structure.\n\nThe removal ensures the codebase reflects the current architectural state where specific permission validation logic is either implemented inline with IPC handlers or managed by the Common trait definitions, avoiding confusion from orphaned stub files.",
			"SHA": "0158bbcdd21075e4419f77fedc6a76253be574af"
		},
		{
